## Original Content
Cette propriété se trouve à l’un des accès de la base navale de Muskö, située à une soixantaine de kilomètres au sud de Stockholm, a indiqué l’armée dans un communiqué.

## Summary
Stockholm, Sweden, plans to expropriate a property owned by a businessman linked to Vladimir Putin. The property is located near the Muskö naval base, about 60 kilometers south of Stockholm, as stated by the military.

## Key Points
- Stockholm intends to expropriate a property.
- The property owner is connected to Vladimir Putin.
- The property is situated near the strategic Muskö naval base.
- The army disclosed this information in a statement.


